          "text": "BUNDLE_START\n{\"path\":\"about.html\",\"content\":\"<!doctype html>\\n<html lang='en'>\\n<head>\\n  <meta charset='utf-8'>\\n  <meta name='viewport' content='width=device-width,initial-scale=1'>\\n  <title>{{BUSINESS_NAME}} — About</title>\\n  <meta name='description' content='About {{THERAPIST_NAME}} — a private practice therapist serving {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}'>\\n  <style>\\n    :root{--bg:#0f0f10;--card:#111214;--accent:#a78bfa;--muted:#bfc8d3;--glass:rgba(255,255,255,0.03)}\\n    html,body{height:100%;margin:0;font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,Segoe UI,Roboto,'Helvetica Neue',Arial;color:#f7f7fb;background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--bg),#070708);}\\n    header{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:22px 36px;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.03)}\\n    .brand{display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:center}\\n    .brand h1{font-size:18px;margin:0;color:#fff}\\n    nav a{color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;margin-left:18px;font-size:14px}\\n    .container{max-width:1100px;margin:36px auto;padding:24px}\\n    .hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 420px;gap:28px;align-items:center;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.02),transparent);padding:36px;border-radius:14px}\\n    .hero h2{font-size:28px;margin:0 0 12px 0;color:#fff}\\n    .hero p{color:var(--muted);margin:0 0 18px 0;line-height:1.6}\\n    .cta{display:inline-block;background:var(--accent);color:#08101a;padding:10px 16px;border-radius:10px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600}\\n    .card{background:var(--card);padding:20px;border-radius:12px}\\n    .diagnostic, .plan, .micro, .pricing{margin-top:24px}\\n    .grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:16px}\\n    ul{margin:12px 0 0 18px;color:var(--muted)}\\n    footer{margin-top:40px;padding:18px;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.03);color:var(--muted)}\\n    .note{font-size:13px;color:#b5bac2;margin-top:10px}\\n    .svg-frame{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;height:220px}\\n    /* subtle gallery feel */\\n    .portrait{border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden}\\n    .meta{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px}\\n  </style>\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n  <header>\\n    <div class='brand'>\\n      <div style='width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#1f1f2b,#23232a);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:var(--accent);font-weight:700'>{{THERAPIST_NAME}}</div>\\n      <div>\\n        <h1>{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</h1>\\n        <div style='font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)'>{{TAGLINE}}</div>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n    <nav>\\n      <a href='index.html'>Home</a>\\n      <a href='specialties.html'>Programs</a>\\n      <a href='approach.html'>Work With Me</a>\\n      <a href='fees.html'>Fees</a>\\n      <a href='contact.html'>Contact</a>\\n    </nav>\\n  </header>\\n\\n  <main class='container'>\\n    <section class='hero'>\\n      <div>\\n        <h2>Offering steady presence for real life change</h2>\\n        <p>I’m {{THERAPIST_NAME}}, a licensed clinician ({{LICENSE}}) working with adults in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}. I blend compassionate, evidence-informed approaches with contemplative practices to support people through anxiety, life transitions, relationship work, and the legacies of trauma.\\n        </p>\\n        <a class='cta' href='{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}'>{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>\\n        <div class='meta'>Sessions by appointment • Virtual and limited in-person availability</div>\\n      </div>\\n      <aside class='card portrait'>\\n        <div class='svg-frame' aria-hidden='true'>\\n          <!-- Unique inline SVG for about.html: gentle arc portrait motif -->\\n          <svg width='320' height='180' viewBox='0 0 320 180' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'>\\n            <defs>\\n              <linearGradient id='gA' x1='0' x2='1'>\\n                <stop offset='0' stop-color='#ffd6fb' stop-opacity='0.12' />\\n                <stop offset='1' stop-color='#c7b3ff' stop-opacity='0.16' />\\n              </linearGradient>\\n            </defs>\\n            <rect x='0' y='0' width='320' height='180' rx='12' fill='url(#gA)' />\\n            <g transform='translate(26,18)'>\\n              <ellipse cx='110' cy='90' rx='56' ry='72' fill='#0b0b0c' opacity='0.6' />\\n              <circle cx='110' cy='70' r='30' fill='#131316' />\\n              <path d='M10 140 Q110 90 210 140' stroke='#a78bfa' stroke-width='6' fill='none' stroke-linecap='round' opacity='0.9'/>\\n            </g>\\n          </svg>\\n        </div>\\n        <div style='padding:14px'>\\n          <strong style='color:#fff'>{{THERAPIST_NAME}}</strong>\\n          <div class='meta'>Licensed {{LICENSE}}</div>\\n        </div>\\n      </aside>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section class='diagnostic card'>\\n      <h3 style='margin:0;color:#fff'>How we begin — an orientation</h3>\\n      <p style='color:var(--muted)'>Our first sessions focus on creating a safe context: understanding what brought you here, clarifying priorities, and mapping supports. This is a collaborative diagnostic conversation, not a one-time test. Below is what to expect.</p>\\n      <div class='grid' style='margin-top:12px'>\\n        <div>\\n          <strong style='color:#fff'>Session intake</strong>\\n          <ul>\\n            <li>Review of current concerns and goals</li>\\n            <li>Brief history and relational patterns</li>\\n            <li>Collaborative safety planning</li>\\n          </ul>\\n        </div>\\n        <div>\\n          <strong style='color:#fff'>Clinical scope</strong>\\n          <ul>\\n            <li>Evidence-informed approaches (CBT, somatic, EMDR-informed integration)</li>\\n            <li>Focus on relationships, transitions, and stress</li>\\n            <li>Not a substitute for emergency or inpatient care</li>\\n          </ul>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section class='plan card'>\\n      <h3 style='color:#fff;margin:0'>The cohort pathway — an invitation</h3>\\n      <p style='color:var(--muted)'>I run a small cohort-style program called the \\\"Companion Cohort\\\" designed for people who want structured support over 12 weeks. It blends short group check-ins with individual sessions and home practices.</p>\\n      <div class='grid' style='margin-top:12px'>\\n        <div>\\n          <strong style='color:#fff'>What’s included</strong>\\n          <ul>\\n            <li>12 weekly group sessions (90 minutes)</li>\\n            <li>Two 50-minute individual sessions</li>\\n            <li>Guided micro-practices and reflection prompts</li>\\n          </ul>\\n        </div>\\n        <div>\\n          <strong style='color:#fff'>Who it suits</strong>\\n          <ul>\\n            <li>People seeking community and structure</li>\\n            <li>Those in life transition or experiencing chronic stress</li>\\n            <li>Not appropriate for acute crisis or active suicidal intent</li>\\n          </ul>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section class='micro card'>\\n      <h3 style='color:#fff;margin:0'>Micro-habits to steady the nervous system</h3>\\n      <p style='color:var(--muted)'>Small practices that compound: brief breath work, two-minute body checks, writing one sentence of acknowledgment each evening.</p>\\n      <ul>\\n        <li>Box breath — 4-4-4-4 for two minutes</li>\\n        <li>Evening noticing: name one small win</li>\\n        <li>Grounding: five senses check during moments of overwhelm</li>\\n      </ul>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section class='pricing card'>\\n      <h3 style='color:#fff;margin:0'>Investment & sessions</h3>\\n      <p style='color:var(--muted)'>I offer single sessions and cohort enrollment. Sliding scale availability is limited; contact for details.</p>\\n      <div class='grid' style='margin-top:12px'>\\n        <div>\\n          <strong style='color:#fff'>Single 50-minute session</strong>\\n          <div style='color:var(--muted)'>Session fee: $150 — standard private-pay rate</div>\\n        </div>\\n        <div>\\n          <strong style='color:#fff'>Companion Cohort</strong>\\n          <div style='color:var(--muted)'>12-week program: $950 (payment options available)</div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class='note'>Insurance: I do not bill insurance directly. I can provide a superbill upon request for out-of-network reimbursement.</div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section class='card' style='margin-top:20px;padding:18px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between'>\\n      <div>\\n        <strong style='color:#fff'>Ready to start?</strong>\\n        <div style='color:var(--muted)'>If you feel this approach may fit, reach out for a brief consult to see if we’re a good match.</div>\\n      </div>\\n      <div>\\n        <a class='cta' href='{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}'>{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <footer>\\n      <div>{{THERAPIST_NAME}} • {{LICENSE}}</div>\\n      <div class='note'>Confidentiality & privacy: sessions are confidential within legal and ethical limits. I will discuss limits to confidentiality during intake, including mandated reporting and imminent risk.\\n      </div>\\n      <div class='note'>Crisis disclaimer: If you or someone else is in immediate danger, contact emergency services or your local crisis line right away. I do not provide crisis services by email.\\n      </div>\\n      <div style='margin-top:8px'>Contact: <a href='tel:{{PHONE}}' style='color:var(--muted)'>{{PHONE}}</a> • <a href='mailto:{{EMAIL}}' style='color:var(--muted)'>{{EMAIL}}</a></div>\\n    </footer>\\n  </main>\\n</body>\\n</html>\"} \n{\"path\":\"specialties.html\",\"content\":\"<!doctype html>\\n<html lang='en'>\\n<head>\\n  <meta charset='utf-8'>\\n  <meta name='viewport' content='width=device-width,initial-scale=1'>\\n  <title>{{BUSINESS_NAME}} — Areas of Focus</title>\\n  <meta name='description' content='Specialties and common presenting issues addressed by {{THERAPIST_NAME}} in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}'>\\n  <style>\\n    :root{--paper:#fff;--ink:#0e1114;--accent:#ffb86b;--soft:#f5f7fb}\\n    html,body{margin:0;padding:0;background:var(--soft);font-family:Georgia,serif;color:var(--ink)}\\n    header{padding:20px 28px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#ffffff, #f8fbff)}\\n    nav a{margin-left:16px;color:#556; text-decoration:none;font-weight:600}\\n    .wrap{max-width:1100px;margin:28px auto;padding:0 20px}\\n    .lead{display:flex;gap:26px;align-items:flex-start}\\n    .lead .left{flex:1}\\n    .lead h2{margin:0;font-family:Georgia,serif;font-size:32px}\\n    .lead p{margin:8px 0 0;color:#475562}\\n    .panel{background:var(--paper);border-radius:14px;padding:18px;margin-top:18px;box-shadow:0 6px 30px rgba(36,50,80,0.05)}\\n    .spec-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:14px;margin-top:12px}\\n    .spec{padding:16px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fff,#fbfcff);border:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.04)}\\n    .spec h4{margin:0 0 8px 0}\\n    .micro-list{display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:12px}\\n    .pill{background:#f1f6ff;padding:8px 12px;border-radius:999px;font-size:13px;color:#274060}\\n    footer{margin-top:28px;padding:22px 0;color:#6b7480;font-size:14px}\\n  </style>\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n  <header>\\n    <div style='display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center'>\\n      <div style='width:46px;height:46px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#ffe0c8,#ffd6b3);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-weight:700'>{{THERAPIST_NAME}}</div>\\n      <div>\\n        <div style='font-weight:700'>{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>\\n        <div style='font-size:13px;color:#6b7480'>{{TAGLINE}}</div>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n    <nav>\\n      <a href='index.html'>Home</a>\\n      <a href='about.html'>Who I Am</a>\\n      <a href='approach.html'>Paths</a>\\n      <a href='fees.html'>Investment</a>\\n      <a href='book.html'>Book</a>\\n      <a href='contact.html'>Contact</a>\\n    </nav>\\n  </header>\\n\\n  <main class='wrap'>\\n    <section class='lead'>\\n      <div class='left'>\\n        <h2>Where I commonly support clients</h2>\\n        <p>My clinical focus is on relational health, regulation, and the meaning-making that follows life change. I emphasize steady presence and concrete practice over quick fixes.</p>\\n      </div>\\n      <aside style='width:300px'>\\n        <div class='panel'>\\n          <strong>Session types</strong>\\n          <div style='color:#6b7480;margin-top:8px'>Individual therapy • Short-term cohorts • Skills series</div>\\n          <div style='margin-top:12px'>\\n            <a href='{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}' style='background:var(--accent);padding:8px 12px;border-radius:8px;color:#fff;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700'>{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      </aside>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section class='panel' style='margin-top:18px'>\\n      <h3 style='margin:0'>Core specialization areas</h3>\\n      <p style='color:#5b6671;margin-top:8px'>These are common presentations and the practical ways I help people move forward.</p>\\n      <div class='spec-grid'>\\n        <div class='spec'>\\n          <h4>Anxiety & Chronic Worry</h4>\\n          <p style='color:#556'>Grounding techniques, exposure-informed planning, and slow regulation to reduce the burden of persistent worry.</p>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class='spec'>\\n          <h4>Complex Trauma & Attachment</h4>\\n          <p style='color:#556'>Phase-oriented work to build safety, re-regulate the nervous system, and repair relational patterns.</p>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class='spec'>\\n          <h4>Relationship Repair & Communication</h4>\\n          <p style='color:#556'>Skills for presence, setting boundaries, and practicing difficult conversations with clarity.</p>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class='spec'>\\n          <h4>Burnout & Work-life Integration</h4>\\n          <p style='color:#556'>Assessing values, workload adjustments, and micro-strategies to restore attention and resilience.</p>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class='spec'>\\n          <h4>Life Transitions</h4>\\n          <p style='color:#556'>Support through endings and beginnings: grief, career change, parenthood, and relocation.</p>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class='spec'>\\n          <h4>Identity & Meaning</h4>\\n          <p style='color:#556'>Exploration of identity shifts and cultivating practices that honor emerging values.</p>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section class='panel' style='margin-top:18px'>\\n      <h3 style='margin:0'>Practical skills I teach</h3>\\n      <div class='micro-list'>\\n        <div class='pill'>Short, repeated breathing</div>\\n        <div class='pill'>Somatic resourcing</div>\\n        <div class='pill'>Boundary scripting</div>\\n        <div class='pill'>Values-based pacing</div>\\n        <div class='pill'>Relational check-ins</div>\\n      </div>\\n      <p style='color:#6b7480;margin-top:12px'>These micro-habits are designed to be integrated into a busy life and to support steady, cumulative change.</p>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section class='panel' style='margin-top:18px'>\\n      <h3 style='margin:0'>Engagement options</h3>\\n      <p style='color:#6b7480;margin-top:8px'>Different rhythms suit different needs — below are common pathways.</p>\\n      <div style='display:flex;gap:12px;margin-top:12px'>\\n        <div style='flex:1;padding:14px;border-radius:10px;background:#fff;border:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.04)'>\\n          <strong>Single session</strong>\\n          <div style='color:#6b6671;margin-top:6px'>A focused 50-minute slot to address a pressing issue or plan next steps.</div>\\n        </div>\\n        <div style='flex:1;padding:14px;border-radius:10px;background:#fff;border:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.04)'>\\n          <strong>Commitment Series</strong>\\n          <div style='color:#6b6671;margin-top:6px'>A 6-10 session series for focused skill-building and measurable change.</div>\\n        </div>\\n        <div style='flex:1;padding:14px;border-radius:10px;background:#fff;border:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.04)'>\\n          <strong>Group cohort</strong>\\n          <div style='color:#6b6671;margin-top:6px'>Small groups for learning skills with peer support and weekly accountability.</div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section class='panel' style='margin-top:18px'>\\n      <h3 style='margin:0'>Fees & framing</h3>\\n      <p style='color:#6b6671;margin-top:8px'>Investment depends on the format. I hold space intentionally and keep groups small to preserve depth and safety.</p>\\n      <div style='display:flex;gap:12px;margin-top:12px'>\\n        <div style='flex:1'>\\n          <strong>Standard session</strong>\\n          <div style='color:#6b6671'>50 min • $150</div>\\n        </div>\\n        <div style='flex:1'>\\n          <strong>Commitment Series</strong>\\n          <div style='color:#6b6671'>6 sessions • $840 (discounted package)</div>\\n        </div>\\n        <div style='flex:1'>\\n          <strong>Cohort pricing</strong>\\n          <div style='color:#6b6671'>Varies by cohort — sliding options available</div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section style='margin-top:20px;text-align:center'>\\n      <div style='display:inline-block;padding:18px 22px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#fff,#fff);box-shadow:0 12px 40px rgba(37,49,74,0.08)'>\\n        <div style='font-weight:700'>Interested in exploring a fit?</div>\\n        <a href='{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}' style='display:inline-block;margin-top:10px;background:#274060;color:#fff;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:10px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700'>{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <footer>\\n      <div style='max-width:1100px;margin:18px auto;color:#6b7480'>\\n        <div>{{THERAPIST_NAME}} • {{LICENSE}} • {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</div>\\n        <div style='margin-top:8px;font-size:13px'>Confidentiality & boundaries: I follow professional ethical standards. If there is an imminent risk of harm, contact emergency services. I do not provide emergency care via email.\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </footer>\\n  </main>\\n</body>\\n</html>\"} \n{\"path\":\"approach.html\",\"content\":\"<!doctype html>\\n<html lang='en'>\\n<head>\\n  <meta charset='utf-8'>\\n  <meta name='viewport' content='width=device-width,initial-scale=1'>\\n  <title>My Approach — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>\\n  <meta name='description' content='Therapeutic approach, methods, and brief plan overview from {{THERAPIST_NAME}}'>\\n  <style>\\n    :root{--bg:#fafbf9;--ink:#0b1720;--muted:#6b7a86;--accent:#6ee7b7}\\n    html,body{margin:0;padding:0;background:var(--bg);font-family:Inter,system-ui,-apple-system,Segoe UI,Roboto;color:var(--ink)}\\n    header{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;padding:18px 24px}\\n    header nav a{margin-left:14px;color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none}\\n    .main{max-width:1000px;margin:28px auto;padding:20px}\\n    .intro{display:flex;gap:20px;align-items:center}\\n    .intro .left{flex:1}\\n    .intro h2{margin:0 0 8px 0}\\n    .approach-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 320px;gap:20px;margin-top:18px}\\n    .card{background:white;border-radius:12px;padding:18px;box-shadow:0 8px 30px rgba(11,23,32,0.06)}\\n    .steps{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;margin-top:12px}\\n    .step{padding:12px;border-radius:8px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fbfffb,#f3fff7);border:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.03)}\\n    .micro{margin-top:14px;color:var(--muted)}\\n    .cta{display:inline-block;margin-top:12px;background:var(--accent);padding:10px 14px;color:#04201a;border-radius:10px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700}\\n    footer{margin-top:26px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}\\n  </style>\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n  <header>\\n    <div style='display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center'>\\n      <div style='width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:10px;background:var(--accent);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-weight:700;color:#04201a'>{{THERAPIST_NAME}}</div>\\n      <div>\\n        <div style='font-weight:700'>{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>\\n        <div style='font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)'>{{TAGLINE}}</div>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n    <nav>\\n      <a href='index.html'>Home</a>\\n      <a href='specialties.html'>Programs</a>\\n      <a href='about.html'>About</a>\\n      <a href='fees.html'>Fees</a>\\n      <a href='book.html'>Book</a>\\n    </nav>\\n  </header>\\n\\n  <main class='main'>\\n    <section class='intro'>\\n      <div class='left'>\\n        <h2>Integrative practice rooted in relationship</h2>\\n        <p style='color:var(--muted)'>My approach is relational and somatically informed. I combine structured skill-building with inquiry so you can learn strategies that reshape how you respond to stress, relationships, and old patterns.</p>\\n      </div>\\n      <aside style='width:260px'>\\n        <div class='card'>\\n          <strong>Modalities</strong>\\n          <div style='color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px'>{{MODALITIES}}</div>\\n          <a class='cta' href='{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}'>{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>\\n        </div>\\n      </aside>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section class='approach-grid'>\\n      <div>\\n        <div class='card'>\\n          <h3 style='margin:0'>A phased clinical map</h3>\\n          <p style='color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px'>Therapy often unfolds in phases. This is a simple map I share with clients to set expectations and collaborate on pacing.</p>\\n          <div class='steps'>\\n            <div class='step'>\\n              <strong>1. Stabilize & orient</strong>\\n              <div style='color:var(--muted);margin-top:6px'>Create safety, build a contained plan, and introduce brief regulation practices.</div>\\n            </div>\\n            <div class='step'>\\n              <strong>2. Process & skill building</strong>\\n              <div style='color:var(--muted);margin-top:6px'>Address patterns and practice new ways of relating to thoughts, sensations, and people.</div>\\n            </div>\\n            <div class='step'>\\n              <strong>3. Integration & independence</strong>\\n              <div style='color:var(--muted);margin-top:6px'>Embed practices, prepare for setbacks, and transition out of regular therapy with a long-term plan.</div>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div class='card' style='margin-top:18px'>\\n          <h3 style='margin:0'>Micro-habits I ask clients to try</h3>\\n          <p style='color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px'>Short, sustainable practices that support each phase.</p>\\n          <ul style='color:var(--muted)'>\\n            <li>Daily 2-minute grounding before important conversations</li>\\n            <li>Evening reflection: one sentence about what helped today</li>\\n            <li>Pre-emptive boundary note: rehearse a brief phrase before setting a limit</li>\\n          </ul>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div class='card' style='margin-top:18px'>\\n          <h3 style='margin:0'>Diagnostic & intake framing</h3>\\n          <p style='color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px'>Initial work is assessment-focused: understanding patterns, supports, and risks. We co-create goals and a realistic timeline.</p>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <aside>\\n        <div class='card' style='margin-bottom:14px'>\\n          <h4 style='margin:0'>Therapeutic metaphors</h4>\\n          <p style='color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px'>I like simple metaphors: learning to steer a boat rather than trying to calm the ocean — practices change how you respond, not the presence of waves.</p>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div class='card'>\\n          <h4 style='margin:0'>Pricing frameworks</h4>\\n          <p style='color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px'>I offer sessional pricing and framed series. Below are example investment options.</p>\\n          <div style='margin-top:10px'>\\n            <div><strong style='display:inline-block;width:140px'>Single session</strong> <span style='color:var(--muted)'>$150</span></div>\\n            <div style='margin-top:6px'><strong style='display:inline-block;width:140px'>Skill series</strong> <span style='color:var(--muted)'>$780 for 6</span></div>\\n            <div style='margin-top:6px'><strong style='display:inline-block;width:140px'>Sliding/Reduced</strong> <span style='color:var(--muted)'>Limited availability</span></div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div class='card' style='margin-top:14px'>\\n          <h4 style='margin:0'>Quick FAQ</h4>\\n          <p style='color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px'><strong>How soon can I start?</strong> Typically within 1–3 weeks depending on availability.</p>\\n          <p style='color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px'><strong>Do you take insurance?</strong> I do not bill insurance directly but can provide a superbill upon request.</p>\\n        </div>\\n      </aside>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section style='margin-top:22px;text-align:center'>\\n      <div style='display:inline-block;padding:18px;border-radius:12px;background:white;box-shadow:0 12px 30px rgba(11,23,32,0.06)'>\\n        <div style='font-weight:700'>Interested in a brief consultation?</div>\\n        <a class='cta' href='{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}' style='display:inline-block'>{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <footer>\\n      <div style='max-width:1000px;margin:18px auto;color:var(--muted)'>\\n        <div>{{THERAPIST_NAME}} • {{LICENSE}} • {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</div>\\n        <div style='margin-top:8px'>Confidentiality: Sessions are confidential within the limits of law and ethics. For emergencies, contact local emergency services or crisis lines; email is not monitored for urgent care.</div>\\n      </div>\\n    </footer>\\n  </main>\\n</body>\\n</html>\"} \nBUNDLE_END"
        }
      ],
